<title>USA: Jayhawk names C. Fred Jackson CFO.</title>
<headline>Jayhawk names C. Fred Jackson CFO.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jayhawk Acceptance Corp said on Friday it had named C. Fred Jackson senior vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The company said Jackson, currrently senior vice president of treasury at Money Store, will join Jayhawk September 16.</p>
